\f1\fs22 Hayley rolled her eyes, not at the lack of crime scene tape across the threshold of Chantara\'92s apartment, but at the door itself, hanging wide open. No sign the place had ever hosted forensics or investigators. Maybe she was seeing it as Chantara had left it, though the open door was an omen she didn\'92t need.\
